        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "Both these applications are decided by this common order because they arise out of\nthe same offence.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 743,
      "end": 843,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "2.  The Applicants are seeking anticipatory bail in connection with C.R.No.1417 of 2022, registered at Hadapsar Police Station, Pune city, on 12.11.2022, under sections 272, 273 Darshan Dattatray Turekar vs State Of Maharashtra on 30 January, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/146813484/\n1 2 of 4 25-aba-3323 & 3357-22 and 328 of the Indian Penal Code and under sections 26(2)(i),\n26(2)(iv), 3(1)(zz)(iv) and 59 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 (hereinafter referred to as 'FSS Act').\n3.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 845,
      "end": 1357,
      "entities": [
        {
