        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "Heard Mr. Ali, learned counsel for the applicants and Ms. Mahalakshmi Ganapathy, learned APP for the State.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1358,
      "end": 1465,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Ali",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 1368,
          "end": 1371
        },
        {
          "text": "Mahalakshmi Ganapathy",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 1416,
          "end": 1437
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "4. The prosecution case is that the F.I.R. was lodged by one Anil Gavte who was the Food Safety Officer, Pune.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1466,
      "end": 1577,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Anil Gavte",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1528,
          "end": 1538
        },
        {
          "text": "Pune",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 1572,
          "end": 1576
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20071840286254883
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "He was called by the police officers on 12.11.2022 at 12.30p.m.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1578,
      "end": 1641,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "12.11.2022",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1618,
          "end": 1628
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.21838608384132385
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "The police had intercepted a tempo bearing No.MH12/LT-1609 carrying banned food articles containing tobacco and pan masala.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1642,
      "end": 1765,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3357354700565338
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "The tempo was searched and the banned food articles namely scented tobacco, pan masala etc. worth Rs.5,58,000/- were seized.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1766,
      "end": 1890,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3233145475387573
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "Four persons namely Anil Dhepe, Shoeb Ansari,\nShahanawaj Ansari and Hidayat Udekari were named in the F.I.R.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1891,
      "end": 1999,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Anil Dhepe",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1911,
          "end": 1921
        },
        {
          "text": "Shoeb Ansari",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1923,
          "end": 1935
        },
        {
          "text": "Shahanawaj Ansari",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1937,
          "end": 1954
        },
        {
          "text": "Hidayat Udekari",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1959,
          "end": 1974
        },
        {
          "text": "F.I.R.",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 1993,
          "end": 1999
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.24469812214374542
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "Out of them, Anil Dhepe was the driver.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2000,
      "end": 2039,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Anil Dhepe",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 2013,
          "end": 2023
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2614579498767853
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "He informed that, he had brought the seized goods with the help of other three persons.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2040,
      "end": 2127,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.27527424693107605
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "The total value of the seized articles is worth Rs.5,58,000/-.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2128,
      "end": 2190,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19544586539268494
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "The investigation revealed that the driver Anil Dhepe was given these food articles by both the present 3 of 4 25-aba-3323 & 3357-22 applicants.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2191,
      "end": 2335,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Anil Dhepe",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 2234,
          "end": 2244
        },
        {
          "text": "25-aba-3323 & 3357-22",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2302,
          "end": 2323
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2897794246673584
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "Therefore, they are apprehending their arrest.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2336,
      "end": 2382,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3242962062358856
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "5. Learned counsel for the applicants submitted that, they have not committed any offence.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2384,
      "end": 2474,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.21015994250774384
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "They are not connected with the arrested accused.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2475,
      "end": 2524,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.339059978723526
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "They are wrongly implicated.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2525,
      "end": 2553,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.26732876896858215
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "He further submitted that,\nSection 328 of the I.P.C. is not attracted.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2554,
      "end": 2624,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 328",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2581,
          "end": 2592
        },
        {
          "text": "I.P.C.",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 2600,
          "end": 2606
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3181766867637634
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "6. Learned APP opposed these submissions.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2625,
      "end": 2667,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1458800882101059
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "She submitted that, in the present applications, both the applicants were protected by ad-interim order and thereafter during pendency of these applications and when they were under protection, they committed another offence which is registered as C.R.No.170 of 2023 at Kavthe Mahankal police station and in that offence the prohibited food articles of a similar nature worth more than Rs.1 Crore were seized.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2668,
      "end": 3077,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "C.R.No.170 of 2023",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 2916,
          "end": 2934
        },
        {
          "text": "Kavthe Mahankal police station",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 2938,
          "end": 2968
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2974945604801178
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "Thus, the applicants have misused their liberty.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3078,
      "end": 3126,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.31196197867393494
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "She further submitted that, this Court, in an identical matter i.e. A.B.A.No.207 of 2024 involving Section 328 of the I.P.C. has passed an order today.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3127,
      "end": 3278,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "A.B.A.No.207 of 2024",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 3195,
          "end": 3215
        },
        {
          "text": "Section 328",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 3226,
          "end": 3237
        },
        {
          "text": "I.P.C.",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 3245,
          "end": 3251
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23597683012485504
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 27,
      "text": "She submitted that, the legal aspects discussed in that order are squarely applicable to the present case.\n7.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 3279,
      "end": 3388,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.16225866973400116
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 28,
      "text": "I have considered these submissions.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 3389,
      "end": 3425,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.12328724563121796
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 29,
      "text": "As far as the 4 of 4 25-aba-3323 & 3357-22 applicability of Section 328 of the I.P.C. is concerned",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 3426,
      "end": 3524,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "25-aba-3323 & 3357-22",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3447,
          "end": 3468
        },
        {
          "text": "Section 328",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 3486,
          "end": 3497
        },
        {
          "text": "I.P.C.",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 3505,
          "end": 3511
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2002347707748413
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 30,
      "text": ", the said issue is discussed in detail in the aforementioned order dated 30.01.2024 passed in A.B.A.No.207 of 2024.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 3525,
      "end": 3641,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "30.01.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3599,
          "end": 3609
        },
        {
          "text": "A.B.A.No.207 of 2024",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 3620,
          "end": 3640
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.08475199341773987
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 31,
      "text": "The reasoning and findings recorded under that order are squarely applicable to the facts and arguments in the present case.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 3642,
      "end": 3766,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.348285436630249
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 32,
      "text": "The applicants have committed another offence of a much higher degree when they were protected by ad-interim order during pendency of these applications and, therefore, they have misused their liberty.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 3767,
      "end": 3968,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5030248165130615
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 33,
      "text": "On all these counts the applicants do not deserve protection U/s.438 of the Cr.p.c.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 3969,
      "end": 4052,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "s.438",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 4032,
          "end": 4037
        },
        {
          "text": "Cr.p.c.",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 4045,
          "end": 4052
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4218699336051941
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 34,
      "text": "Their custodial interrogation is necessary.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 4053,
      "end": 4096,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.27739813923835754
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 35,
      "text": "8. Hence, both the applications are rejected.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 4098,
      "end": 4143,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2870602607727051
    },
